Jfrog Artifactory Configuration with Jenkins

Cat /opt/maven/conf/settings.xml
In servers location,
<servers>
    <server>
      <username>admin</username>
      <password>Password123</password>
      <id>central</id>
    </server>
    <server>
      <username>admin</username>
      <password>Password123</password>
      <id>snapshots</id>
    </server>
  </servers>

In Profiles location,

<profiles>
    <profile>
      <repositories>
        <repository>
          <snapshots>
            <enabled>false</enabled>
          </snapshots>
          <id>central</id>
          <name>mvn-jfrog-libs-release</name>
          <url>https://10.100.23.3:8082/artifactory/mvn-jfrog-libs-release</url>
        </repository>
        <repository>
          <snapshots />
          <id>snapshots</id>
          <name>mvn-jfrog-libs-snapshot</name>
          <url>https://10.100.23.3:8082/artifactory/mvn-jfrog-libs-snapshot</url>
        </repository>
      </repositories>
      <pluginRepositories>
        <pluginRepository>
          <snapshots>
            <enabled>false</enabled>
          </snapshots>
          <id>central</id>
          <name>mvn-jfrog-libs-release</name>
          <url>https://10.100.23.3:8082/artifactory/mvn-jfrog-libs-release</url>
        </pluginRepository>
        <pluginRepository>
          <snapshots />
          <id>snapshots</id>
          <name>mvn-jfrog-libs-snapshot</name>
          <url>https://10.100.23.3:8082/artifactory/mvn-jfrog-libs-snapshot</url>
        </pluginRepository>
      </pluginRepositories>
      <id>artifactory</id>
    </profile>
  </profiles>
  <activeProfiles>
    <activeProfile>artifactory</activeProfile>
  </activeProfiles>

In Jfrog Artifactory,
 
Welcome,admin > Set Me Up
 

Click on Generate Settings
Download snippet and Pom file will be generated
 
